SUMMARY:Renew CViche SAML SP cert (expires 2029-05-19)
LOCATION:WCM ITS Service Portal
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:CViche SAML SP cert expires 2029-05-19 (3-year validity\, generated 2026-05-20).\n\nProcess:\n1. Regenerate keypair with openssl (same subject\, 3-year).\n2. File a WCM ITS follow-up to the original ticket RITM0791615\, attaching the new public cert.\n3. After IT confirms\, atomically swap the new keypair into 1Password + AWS Secrets Manager + the cviche-saml-sp-cert K8s Secret.\n4. Rotate the deployment (kubectl rollout restart deploy/cviche-backend -n cviche-dev).\n\nRefs:\n- docs/sp-registration.md SP Certificate section\n- ~/Dropbox/Projects/CViche - Planning/saml-its-form-prod.md\n- Original cert SHA-256: 5B:C2:43:CD:76:CC:21:B2:DD:D8:1E:B2:34:44:51:73:F1:AC:3C:DD:65:01:B0:2B:1F:42:0A:A2:B6:B8:1A:47
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:CViche SAML SP cert renewal: 30 days out
TRIGGER:-P30D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:CViche SAML SP cert renewal: 7 days out
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
